---
const site = import.meta.env.PAPERBOAT_SITE_URL || "/"
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="col">
    <p>
      Checks run every minute from independent locations. A service is shown as down only when at least two of them agree.
      Uptime counts minutes with a major outage as down and degraded minutes as 30% down; minutes without fresh data are not counted.
      Availability is reported at an aggregate level, and individual availability may vary.
    </p>
    <p class="foot-links"><a href={site}>Paperboat</a> · <a href="/api/feed.xml">RSS</a> · <a href="/history/">Incident history</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>
